      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Bracketed classification layout. Black Teas (a) Northern: Keemun, Ningchow, Moning are bracketed together against 'Anhui' and 'Kiangsi' (the individual assignment is not printed), and that bracket against the remark 'representing one quarter of the total production of the North.'; the remark is repeated on each of the three rows.",
        "Black Teas: Oopacks (Sungyang ... Cheongshukai) bracketed to 'Hupeh.'; Oonahms (Oanfa ... Shuntam) bracketed to 'Hunan.'. (b) Southern: Congou (Panyong ... Suey Kuts) and Oolong (Foochow) are bracketed to 'Fukien.'; the right-hand list (Scented Capers ... Flowery Pekoe) stands to the right of 'Fukien.' outside the bracket, with no province printed against it, so Province is left empty (not unreadable).",
        "'Province.' is printed as a column heading over the Black Teas (a) Northern block and over the Green Teas block.",
        "Green Teas and Blends are printed side by side on p. 147 but are separate lists; given as separate parts.",
        "38 data rows counted on the pages (Black Teas 25 on p. 146; Green Teas 6 and Blends 7 on p. 147); 38 transcribed.",
        "Italic heading words (Northern, Southern) not marked; group headings 'Oopacks', 'Oonahms', 'Congou' put in the Group column.",
        "No totals printed."
      ],
